menuconfig THINKPAD_T430_STATUS
    bool "ThinkPad T430 indicator LEDs"
    default y if SHIELD_THINKPAD_T430 || SHIELD_THINKPAD_T430_REVA
    depends on ZMK_BLE && ZMK_USB
    help
      Drives the T430 power-button LED with USB/BLE connection status, drives
      three BLE-profile indicators, and mirrors the dedicated
      speaker/microphone mute buttons to their LEDs.

config THINKPAD_T430_REVA_BACKLIGHT
    bool "ThinkPad T430 Revision A sequenced backlight"
    default y if SHIELD_THINKPAD_T430_REVA
    depends on PWM && GPIO
    help
      Drives the Revision A backlight PWM and sequences its active-high 5 V
      rail enable so PWM is never applied before the rail has stabilized.

config THINKPAD_T430_REVA_USB_BOOT_TRIGGER
    bool "ThinkPad T430 Revision A 1200-baud UF2 trigger"
    default y if SHIELD_THINKPAD_T430_REVA
    depends on SERIAL && UART_LINE_CTRL
    help
      Reboots into the UF2 bootloader when the USB CDC ACM control port is
      opened at 1200 baud. This permits button-free firmware updates.

menuconfig THINKPAD_T470_MATRIX_DISCOVERY
    bool "ThinkPad T470 matrix discovery logging"
    default n
    depends on LOG
    help
      Guides the user through the US T470 layout and records each raw
      DRV/SENSE coordinate. Enable only when remapping another keyboard.

menuconfig THINKPAD_T470_STATUS
    bool "ThinkPad T470 BLE profile LEDs"
    default y if SHIELD_THINKPAD_T470
    depends on ZMK_BLE && ZMK_USB
    help
      Uses three nRF52840 DK LEDs to show selected BLE profile, pairing,
      connection, and reconnection state.
